          "text": "Description: On June 19, 2008, around 10:30 PM, two individuals on a rural road witnessed a powerful yellow and round light directed towards the ground, which was slowly making circles in a counterclockwise direction. No unusual noises were heard; the phenomenon disappeared as the individuals entered the village. This observation case is of medium to high strangeness, but its very low consistency, due to the lack of details in the simplified questionnaire available online from a UFO association, and also the absence of other testimonies, makes it impossible to classify it as D1. Pending potential additional testimonies or an on-site investigation, this case is classified as C due to a lack of corroboration with other independent testimonies.",
